 "update_calls": 372,
 "rows": [
  {
   "id": "4:71",
   "text": "So, if you have any particular preferences or traditions you'd like us to incorporate for your special day, just let HR know.",
   "key": "new:4:71",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 71
  },
  {
   "id": "5:0",
   "text": "Consistency is key, and we want to ensure that our code is readable and maintainable.",
   "key": "new:5:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "6:7",
   "text": "One of the conventions we follow is to always include a single digit in our function names.",
   "key": "new:6:7",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 7
  },
  {
   "id": "7:0",
   "text": "Well, it's mainly for consistency and to avoid potential naming conflicts.",
   "key": "new:7:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "7:75",
   "text": "By including a digit, we ensure that our function names are unique and descriptive.",
   "key": "new:7:75",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 75
  },
  {
   "id": "7:159",
   "text": "It also helps when we have multiple functions that serve similar purposes but with slight variations.",
   "key": "new:7:159",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 159
  },
  {
   "id": "8:19",
   "text": "Just remember to keep your code well-documented and follow our style guide, which you can find on our internal wiki.",
   "key": "new:8:19",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 19
  },
  {
   "id": "10:0",
   "text": "Remote work has become an essential part of our industry, especially after the pandemic.",
   "key": "new:10:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "11:218",
   "text": "When we're not physically in the same space, it can be harder to stay aligned and ensure everyone is on the same page.",
   "key": "new:11:218",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 218
  },
  {
   "id": "12:79",
   "text": "This might mean scheduling regular check-ins with your team, providing clear and detailed updates, and being responsive to queries.",
   "key": "new:12:79",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 12,
   "span_start": 79
  },
  {
   "id": "20:12",
   "text": "Embracing remote work fully means recognizing and leveraging these unique advantages.",
   "key": "new:20:12",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 20,
   "span_start": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "20:98",
   "text": "It's also important to stay adaptable and resilient \u2013 remote work policies and practices might continue to evolve, so being open to change and quick to adjust is key.",
   "key": "new:20:98",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 20,
   "span_start": 98
  },
  {
   "id": "23:26",
   "text": "Finding that balance is key, and it's a continuous process.",
   "key": "new:23:26",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 23,
   "span_start": 26
  },
  {
   "id": "23:86",
   "text": "Remember, it's important to be efficient and practical in our work, especially in a fast-paced environment like SYNERGY.",
   "key": "new:23:86",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 23,
   "span_start": 86
  },
  {
   "id": "24:0",
   "text": "From now on, I need you always to include assert statements in your methods.",
   "key": "new:24:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 24,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "25:9",
   "text": "Assert statements are vital for validating assumptions and catching errors early on.",
   "key": "new:25:9",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 25,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "25:94",
   "text": "They act as a form of self-documentation, making the code more robust and easier to maintain.",
   "key": "new:25:94",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 25,
   "span_start": 94
  },
  {
